                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wu EJAKAIT, emamei yeneputos kajo, emamei da Edeke ece dimarai ijo, kwape ajaatar kere nukipou keirasi kakosiki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani bo ateker adio kakwap naeputos kikonituna Isirael, luabu Edeke kolot alakun kanuke araun ituŋa, adumakin ekiror kakiro nukos ka nusogim, irenei atekerin kakonyen nuka ikonituŋa luibu kolaku koMisiri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naarai ikonituŋa Isiraei ibu kitarau ikonituŋa ikar kere; ijo da, EJAKAIT, ibu koraun Edekekec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aso do, wu EJAKAIT, kitogogonoi akirot naibu kiner naka ekonikeiaanakinan, ka ekekike ikar kere, kiswama kwape kineria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
